    "sections": {
        "description": "Logistic WordPress Theme. Logistic Hub is a free, modern WordPress block theme designed specifically for logistics and transportation businesses. Fully compatible with the Gutenberg and Block Editor, this theme allows for seamless content creation and customization. The theme comes with a range of pre-designed patterns and a front-page template, including sections for a striking Hero Banner, Team showcases, Pricing tables, FAQs, and more. These predefined layouts enable users to quickly set up a professional and functional website. The clean, minimalist design focuses on efficient use of white space, ensuring the content stands out and offers an intuitive browsing experience. Whether you're a logistics company, freight service provider, or courier business, Logistic Hub provides all the tools to create a polished, user-friendly online presence."
    },
